    "describe_ch": "課程中將介紹專題之整理、分析以及表達方法之基礎、操作原理、研究生專題演講訓練、專題報告撰寫整理及分析。\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "The course contains introduction of composition, analysis and representation with special research topics and operating principles of the seminar, training of a talk representation with special topics of the graduate student, training to writing and analysis of the special topics work.",
